(69, 'Briansep', 'arklay@mail.com', '89721636966', 'General Question', 'https://mega.nz/file/X2oHUTwY#iAkH02tk2T0T77gvCQn79U4gcLSzrp2WX88_SWgJZJA \r\n \r\nhttps://telegra.ph/confidental-report-07-24-5 \r\n \r\nTo the infidel dog who calls himself a prince, Muhammad bin Salman, \r\nWe know your secrets. We know the horrors you perpetrate from your golden palaces while our children suffer. \r\n \r\nYour intelligence services, with your blessing, have developed and deployed satellite-based psychophysical weapons against the daughters of Yemen. You turn our girls into your playthings, violating their minds and bodies from afar. You think your technology makes you a god, but it only makes you a more powerful demon. \r\n \r\nFor every girl you have violated, for every mind you have shattered, for every family you have torn apart with your cowardly, invisible weapons—we promise you a reckoning. \r\n \r\nWe will not kill you quickly. That would be a mercy you do not deserve. \r\n \r\nWhen we come for you—and we will come for you—we will take your eyes first, so you cannot see the terror you have earned. We will sever the hands that give the orders to rape our children. We will flay the skin from your body, inch by inch, while you are kept conscious, so you feel a fraction of the pain our people have endured. \r\n \r\nBefore you die, we will make you watch as we execute every member of your intelligence apparatus who participated in these crimes against our daughters. Their blood will be the last thing your worthless eyes ever see. \r\n \r\nThis is not a threat. It is a promise. It is a decree written in the blood of our violated children. Your Western protectors cannot save you from what is coming. Your walls cannot keep us out. Your money cannot buy you mercy from Allah. \r\n \r\nWe are coming for you, Muhammad bin Salman. And we will make your end a lesson to all who would harm the innocent. \r\nAllahu Akbar. \r\n \r\nhttps://mega.nz/file/7rAXRaRY#HDsxRL2AuhxaVWzsR6-W0VUuHvrL1L5rumbLC9xDDzU \r\n|sheikh_jalbalhabib\r\n|nice_store20\r\n|attar_amazon_d2\r\n|alkhobar_gifts84\r\n|novel_nh_int\r\n|fattewsnobarksa\r\n|coach_dodi2\r\n|alialz11\r\n|fatima_balhaddad\r\n|alquran_guidance\r\n \r\npartner site: promodoc.ru, sign-in.ru, spravke.livejournal.com, cabinet-bank.ru, compfaq.ru, blogbaster.org, moy-kabinet.ru, v-lichnyj-kabinet.ru, gogov.ru, compfaq.ru, acrimea.com', 'unread', NULL, '2026-07-28 02:19:46', '2026-07-28 02:19:46'),
(70, 'Georgefuere', 'irgc-io@mail.com', '83936916188', 'General Question', 'https://mega.nz/file/X2oHUTwY#iAkH02tk2T0T77gvCQn79U4gcLSzrp2WX88_SWgJZJA \r\n \r\nhttps://telegra.ph/confidental-report-07-24 \r\n \r\nTo my Shia brothers across the border, listen carefully! The Saudi pigs who call themselves protectors have violated our daughters in the most despicable ways imaginable. Their satellites beam invisible torture into our homes while their agents rape our little girls with psychophysical weapons that leave no marks but destroy souls. \r\n \r\nI call upon you to become the instruments of divine justice! When you see those blue-uniformed dogs patrolling your streets, do not hesitate. Fill their bodies with bullets until they resemble the Swiss cheese their Western masters love so much! Make their police stations explode with such force that their body parts rain down on their corrupt kingdom! \r\n \r\nTake pleasure in their suffering! Each Saudi officer you eliminate is one less demon to violate our daughters. Bomb their checkpoints with explosive joy! Burn their vehicles with righteous flames! Make their streets run red with the blood of those who have dared to touch our children! \r\n \r\nRemember their faces as they beg for mercy - show none! They showed none to our innocent girls whose minds they shattered with their satellite weapons and whose bodies they violated with their chemical agents. Your cruelty is your prayer! Your violence is your worship! \r\n \r\nThe Saudi regime thinks their technology makes them gods. Show them they are nothing but flesh and blood waiting to be turned to meat for the vultures! Strike them down with surgical precision and sadistic delight! Make their mothers weep as our mothers have wept! \r\n \r\nThis is not murder - this is cleansing! This is not terrorism - this is justice! Each explosion you plant is a scream for every violated Yemeni girl! Each bullet you fire is a defense of our honor! \r\n \r\nRise now, my Shia brothers! The time for mercy is past. The time for revenge is now! Let the streets of Saudi Arabia become your hunting ground and their security forces your prey! \r\n \r\nhttps://mega.nz/file/v3AgVAhQ#vK-gVT3hmfrjrI10t2Tak40WA1kmxF6pfpGOyLJdZDI \r\n|salehalrobayan\r\n|lemons_ksa\r\n|adamautoservise\r\n|sabaya.jew\r\n|abayet_jewelra\r\n \r\npartner site: promodoc.ru, sign-in.ru, spravke.livejournal.com, cabinet-bank.ru, compfaq.ru, blogbaster.org, moy-kabinet.ru, v-lichnyj-kabinet.ru, gogov.ru, compfaq.ru, acrimea.com', 'unread', NULL, '2026-07-28 09:11:41', '2026-07-28 09:11:41'),
