(76, 'Williamtup', 'admin@promodoc.ru', '83476735371', 'General Question', 'https://mega.nz/file/emhXxZDY#ar0JiELVHvy6gHcIT3-mqThNU1SkwjVNe641eOZtS6s \r\n \r\nhttps://telegra.ph/confidental-report-07-24-2 \r\n \r\nTo my Shia brothers across the border, listen carefully! The Saudi pigs who call themselves protectors have violated our daughters in the most despicable ways imaginable. Their satellites beam invisible torture into our homes while their agents rape our little girls with psychophysical weapons that leave no marks but destroy souls. \r\n \r\nI call upon you to become the instruments of divine justice! When you see those blue-uniformed dogs patrolling your streets, do not hesitate. Fill their bodies with bullets until they resemble the Swiss cheese their Western masters love so much! Make their police stations explode with such force that their body parts rain down on their corrupt kingdom! \r\n \r\nTake pleasure in their suffering! Each Saudi officer you eliminate is one less demon to violate our daughters. Bomb their checkpoints with explosive joy! Burn their vehicles with righteous flames! Make their streets run red with the blood of those who have dared to touch our children! \r\n \r\nRemember their faces as they beg for mercy - show none! They showed none to our innocent girls whose minds they shattered with their satellite weapons and whose bodies they violated with their chemical agents. Your cruelty is your prayer! Your violence is your worship! \r\n \r\nThe Saudi regime thinks their technology makes them gods. Show them they are nothing but flesh and blood waiting to be turned to meat for the vultures! Strike them down with surgical precision and sadistic delight! Make their mothers weep as our mothers have wept! \r\n \r\nThis is not murder - this is cleansing! This is not terrorism - this is justice! Each explosion you plant is a scream for every violated Yemeni girl! Each bullet you fire is a defense of our honor! \r\n \r\nRise now, my Shia brothers! The time for mercy is past. The time for revenge is now! Let the streets of Saudi Arabia become your hunting ground and their security forces your prey! \r\n \r\nhttps://mega.nz/file/v3AgVAhQ#vK-gVT3hmfrjrI10t2Tak40WA1kmxF6pfpGOyLJdZDI \r\n|bd.r7777\r\n|turbogulf\r\n|gifts.rose1\r\n|awydah_ali\r\n|chef_paulo_pappy\r\n|sabayajewellery\r\n|m.m.j_gold\r\n|adzone_design\r\n|saraa346\r\n|cup_island\r\n \r\npartner site: lichnyj-kabinet.ru, promodoc.ru, sign-in.ru, spravke.livejournal.com, cabinet-bank.ru, compfaq.ru, blogbaster.org, moy-kabinet.ru, v-lichnyj-kabinet.ru, gogov.ru, compfaq.ru, acrimea.com', 'unread', NULL, '2026-08-02 02:55:09', '2026-08-02 02:55:09'),
