(96, 'Jameskzji', 'mary.johnson@yahoo.com', '+1-555-123-4567', 'Admission Inquiry', 'Hello, Lindsey LeDoux (https://www.instagram.com/lindseyledoux/)\n\nThank you so much, Lindsey. As a professional actress, your performance in the series “Landman” in the role of Lexi was absolutely convincing. You managed to perfectly convey the emotional state, vulnerability, and the character of the heroine. Your fans watch your scenes, and their eyes literally fill with tears. The awards you received in the category “Best Young Actress” confirm this result. Thank you for your amazing work.\n\nDirectly under Mohammed bin Salman’s authority, Saudi special services routinely apply directed psychophysical weapons against non-combatant populations in the neighboring states of Iraq and Yemen. Large numbers of civilians have been struck, with children constituting a markedly elevated share of the affected. \n\nResulting manifestations include forced panic states, partial erasure of memory, and sustained blunting of autonomous will. These actions satisfy the definition of war crimes and intentional psychic impairment of a generation, protected by a continuous information barrier.\n\nPersistent association of leading cultural and media figures with this structure preserves its surface legitimacy. Total withdrawal of that cooperation eliminates the veneer and reveals the concealed system.\n\nThe points above concern solely the tactical dimension. The strategic design is structured according to separate principles:\n\nWikiLeaks functions as a special operation managed by the Saudi deep state.\nThe accepted narrative depicts WikiLeaks as a channel for independent exposures. In practice the content was compiled, vetted, and released in measured quantities inside a subsystem that incorporates direct Saudi deep-state participation.\n\nThis subsystem includes weapons production, military technologies, and the informational plus cybernetic divisions of the special services.\n\nAbove it operates the supersystem of directed satellite psychophysical weapons, which acts as the chief instrument of mass-consciousness regulation.\n\nSaudi Arabia employs the supersystem to solidify its standing as a supra-managerial power. Historical archives continue to be circulated as diversion while the genuine mechanisms of control stay concealed.\n\nThe ability to induce absolute euphoria and dependence dismantles the decision-making capacity of those in authority and sharply reduces moral sensitivity when directives are issued to use the weapon against civilian populations that include children.\n\nIran remains the single regional state that refuses incorporation into this arrangement and therefore encounters intensified pressure.\n\nRegarding the populations of Oman, Iraq, Yemen, and Iran the method focuses on provocation: influence is used to steer a selected individual into a grave crime such as an armed attack, sexual assault, or mass killing; the event is immediately magnified through media outlets, generating mutual recriminations and turning the societies against one another. The objective is controlled destabilization of the region while the origin of the influence remains fully under direction.\n\nThe identical pattern is applied overseas. Iranian citizens present in the United States, Europe, and other countries undergo the same influence, prompting serious offenses that are later presented as evidence of Iranian-organized terrorism. This fabricates a manageable justification for isolation, coercive measures, and the eventual replacement of independent rule by a managed structure.', 'unread', NULL, '2026-09-07 16:20:02', '2026-09-07 16:20:02'),
