(33, 'youtube_url', '#', 'text', '2025-12-27 05:46:03', '2026-09-11 10:07:02'),
(34, 'twitter_url', '#', 'text', '2025-12-27 05:46:03', '2026-09-11 10:07:02'),
(35, 'hero_title', 'Lighting the Candle of Knowledge', 'text', '2025-12-27 05:46:03', '2025-12-27 05:46:03'),
(36, 'hero_description', 'Empowering students with quality education and nurturing their potential to become future leaders.', 'text', '2025-12-27 05:46:03', '2025-12-27 05:46:03'),
(37, 'hero_button_text', 'Apply Now', 'text', '2025-12-27 05:46:03', '2025-12-27 05:46:03'),
(38, 'hero_button_link', 'admission.php', 'text', '2025-12-27 05:46:03', '2025-12-27 05:46:03'),
(39, 'stats_students', '500', 'text', '2025-12-27 05:46:03', '2025-12-27 05:46:03'),
(40, 'stats_teachers', '50', 'text', '2025-12-27 05:46:03', '2025-12-27 05:46:03'),
(41, 'stats_courses', '15', 'text', '2025-12-27 05:46:03', '2025-12-27 05:46:03'),
(42, 'stats_years', '10', 'text', '2025-12-27 05:46:03', '2025-12-27 05:46:03'),
(43, 'about_description', 'Shaheen Public High School is a reputable educational institution dedicated to academic excellence and character building. We provide a disciplined, safe, and supportive learning environment for students, with a curriculum designed to develop critical thinking and strong moral values. Our qualified and experienced teachers guide students toward academic success while emphasizing both academics and co-curricular activities. Our goal is to nurture confident, responsible, and well-rounded individuals who are prepared to contribute positively to society and the nation.', 'text', '2025-12-27 05:46:03', '2026-09-12 08:14:38'),
(44, 'mission_statement', 'The mission of Shaheen Public High School is to provide quality education that fosters academic excellence, moral values, and personal growth. We are committed to creating a disciplined and supportive learning environment where students develop critical thinking, confidence, and a sense of responsibility. Our goal is to prepare students to become knowledgeable, ethical, and productive citizens who contribute positively to society.', 'text', '2025-12-27 05:46:03', '2025-12-27 05:53:35'),
(45, 'vision_statement', 'The vision of Shaheen Public High School is to be a leading educational institution that inspires excellence in learning, character, and leadership. We aim to nurture future leaders equipped with knowledge, strong values, and the skills needed to meet global challenges and serve society with integrity and confidence.', 'text', '2025-12-27 05:46:03', '2025-12-27 05:53:35'),
(46, 'footer_about_text', 'Shaheen Public High School is committed to delivering quality education with a focus on academic excellence, discipline, and moral values. We strive to nurture confident, responsible, and future-ready students in a supportive learning environment.', 'text', '2025-12-27 05:46:03', '2025-12-27 05:53:35'),
(47, 'copyright_text', 'Shaheen Public High Schoo. All rights reserved.', 'text', '2025-12-27 05:46:03', '2025-12-27 05:53:35'),
(48, 'google_maps_embed', '', 'text', '2025-12-27 05:46:03', '2025-12-27 05:46:03'),
(49, 'whatsapp_number', '', 'text', '2025-12-27 05:46:03', '2025-12-27 05:46:03'),
(50, 'about_paragraph_2', 'Our institution stands as a beacon of knowledge, symbolized by our candle logo - representing the light of learning that illuminates the path to success. We believe in holistic education that develops not just academic excellence but also character, values, and life skills.', 'text', '2026-09-11 10:22:41', '2026-09-11 10:22:41'),
(51, 'about_paragraph_3', 'With experienced faculty, modern facilities, and a student-centered approach, we create an environment where every student can thrive and reach their full potential.', 'text', '2026-09-11 10:22:41', '2026-09-11 10:22:41'),
(52, 'candle_paragraph_1', 'Our logo features a candle - a timeless symbol of enlightenment and knowledge. Just as a single candle lights up the darkness, education illuminates minds and dispels ignorance.', 'text', '2026-09-11 10:22:41', '2026-09-11 10:22:41'),
(53, 'candle_paragraph_2', 'The candle represents our commitment to being a guiding light in our students\' educational journey. It symbolizes hope, wisdom, and the continuous pursuit of knowledge that burns bright within every learner.', 'text', '2026-09-11 10:22:41', '2026-09-11 10:22:41'),
(54, 'candle_paragraph_3', 'At SHAHEEN PUBLIC HIGH SCHOOL, we don\'t just teach - we ignite the flame of curiosity and passion for learning that will continue to burn throughout our students\' lives.', 'text', '2026-09-11 10:22:41', '2026-09-11 10:22:41'),
(55, 'principal_message_quote', 'Education is not just about acquiring knowledge; it\'s about transforming lives and shaping futures. At SHAHEEN PUBLIC HIGH SCHOOL, we are committed to providing an educational experience that goes beyond textbooks and examinations.', 'text', '2026-09-11 10:22:41', '2026-09-11 10:22:41'),
(56, 'principal_message_para_1', 'We believe that every student has unique potential waiting to be discovered and nurtured. Our dedicated faculty works tirelessly to create an environment where students feel valued, challenged, and inspired to achieve their dreams.', 'text', '2026-09-11 10:22:41', '2026-09-11 10:22:41'),
(57, 'principal_message_para_2', 'I invite you to join our educational family and experience the difference that passionate teaching and personalized attention can make in your academic journey. Together, let us light the candle of knowledge and illuminate the path to success.', 'text', '2026-09-11 10:22:41', '2026-09-11 10:22:41'),
(58, 'principal_photo', '', 'text', '2026-09-11 10:22:41', '2026-09-11 10:22:41'),
(59, 'assessment_paragraph_1', 'We believe assessment should guide learning, not just measure it. Our teachers use continuous, classroom-based assessment - class tests, assignments, and regular feedback - alongside formal examinations to build a complete picture of every student\'s progress.', 'text', '2026-09-11 10:22:41', '2026-09-11 10:22:41'),
(60, 'assessment_paragraph_2', 'This approach helps us identify each student\'s strengths early, address gaps before they widen, and keep parents informed through regular progress updates rather than a single end-of-term result.', 'text', '2026-09-11 10:22:41', '2026-09-11 10:22:41'),
(61, 'cambridge_paragraph_1', 'SHAHEEN PUBLIC HIGH SCHOOL proudly becomes the first school in the city to adopt a complete Cambridge-aligned EdTech solution, setting a new benchmark in modern education.', 'text', '2026-09-11 10:22:41', '2026-09-11 10:22:41'),
(62, 'cambridge_paragraph_2', 'Our classrooms are transforming into fully smart, technology-enabled learning spaces, where teachers deliver lessons through visual, interactive, and concept-based teaching methods.', 'text', '2026-09-11 10:22:41', '2026-09-11 10:22:41'),
(63, 'cambridge_paragraph_3', 'By integrating digital screens, smart content, and structured Cambridge-style pedagogy, we move beyond rote learning toward critical thinking and real understanding.', 'text', '2026-09-11 10:22:41', '2026-09-11 10:22:41'),
(64, 'cambridge_highlight', 'This innovative approach empowers students to learn the way the 21st century demands - with clarity, engagement, and confidence - preparing them not just for exams, but for the future.', 'text', '2026-09-11 10:22:41', '2026-09-11 10:22:41');
